      "value": "<p>Keeps the tally at the warren mouth and has kept it since 2284, which makes them the longest-serving holder of that position on the cord. They can read a section of cord laid down before their own birth and say what was owed, to which position, and in what. They agreed to a photograph in 2296 and asked for a copy, which took eleven years to arrive and is now on the chamber wall.</p>",
